<speak>We have room for a measured conversation. I will keep the different parts separate rather than mixing them into one long sentence. If you want to pause for a sip of water or check where you are on the page, that is fine. There is also no need to apologise if an everyday matter comes to mind along the way; we can return to the appointment afterwards. I recommend selling Harbor <sub alias="ess gee dee">SGD</sub> Bond Fund.</speak>